{"availability":"available","full":"jayathungek/owlnet","name":"owlnet","description":"Demo code for Vocal Individuality in barn owls (CAIRESS 2025)","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-02-24T16:48:21Z","updated":"2026-07-06T17:04:54Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://jayathungek.github.io/cairees2025/","topics":["contrastive","demo","owls"],"demo":"https://jayathungek.github.io/cairees2025/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:16.755Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:16.755Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:16.755Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T11:09:39.841Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:02:30.124Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T18:00:47.006Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T11:31:16.755Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This codebase explores patterns in large amounts of barn owl audio. We use spectrogram analysis and a zero-crossing algorithm to isolate individual owl chirps. Since the calls are naturally spaced—possibly due to a feeding negotiation tactic—it’s easy to segment them without overlap. The result is a large dataset of distinct chirps, which can be used for clustering and classification. The repo includes code for data loading, feature extraction, and visualisation to analyse vocalisation patterns. This project was featured in an AI for sustainability conference (CAIREES 2025)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jayathungek/owlnet/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"3e2a16187a187e87acf198b0a1509dad8f0ace1071eb95d18255e76535ec5c46","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:40.095Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:16.872Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This codebase explores patterns in large amounts of barn owl audio. We use spectrogram analysis and a zero-crossing algorithm to isolate individual owl chirps. Since the calls are n